    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 30 Answer: Take off all the masks and see Sweetheart's true face</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>

    <div class="verify-note">Heads up: a few of the gift-reaction steps below were reconstructed from a single walkthrough video. The overall sequence is confirmed, but if one tap looks different on your screen, cross-check the embedded video at that timestamp before retrying.</div>
    <div class="answer-box">
      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
      <p>Peel Sweetheart down layer by layer: ice block, golden masquerade mask, black eye mask, party hat, then the three gift-offering beats (skincare, ginseng, gold watch), and finally pull the curtain open. The true face behind the curtain is the level's punchline.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Watch the full solution<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>The video is the fastest way to copy this level move-for-move — some moves are drags, not taps, and text alone can't show the gesture. Timestamps for every move are in the walkthrough below.</p>
    <div class="video-wrap" id="video">
      <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/blrfxQPl7Ss" title="Brain Puzzle 3 Level 30 walkthrough video" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
    <InContentAd />

    <h2>Level 30 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 1</span>
      <strong>Tap the ice block, then the golden mask, then the black eye mask</strong>
      <img src="/brain-puzzle-3/l27_step1.jpg" alt="Brain Puzzle 3 level 30 step 1" loading="lazy" />
      <p>Three quick removals in a row: the ice around her head shatters, the golden masquerade mask comes off, and the small black eye mask under it follows. She pops on a party hat.</p>
      <p class="ts">Video check: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=blrfxQPl7Ss&t=13s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">0:13</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 2</span>
      <strong>Tap the party hat off</strong>
      <img src="/brain-puzzle-3/l27_step2.jpg" alt="Brain Puzzle 3 level 30 step 2" loading="lazy" />
      <p>Removing the hat flips her mood: she starts crying, which sets up the gift sequence that follows.</p>
      <p class="ts">Video check: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=blrfxQPl7Ss&t=26s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">0:26</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 3</span>
      <strong>Offer the skincare product, the ginseng and the gold watch, tapping through each reaction</strong>
      <img src="/brain-puzzle-3/l27_step3.jpg" alt="Brain Puzzle 3 level 30 step 3" loading="lazy" />
      <p>Each gift cracks or changes her face one more layer: skincare cracks the mask face, the ginseng letter removes the medical mask, the gold watch turns her eyes to gold coins.</p>
      <p class="ts">Video check: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=blrfxQPl7Ss&t=32s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">0:32</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 4</span>
      <strong>Tap the pink curtain to open it</strong>
      <img src="/brain-puzzle-3/l27_step4.jpg" alt="Brain Puzzle 3 level 30 step 4" loading="lazy" />
      <p>The final reveal: behind the curtain \"Sweetheart\" is a large man in a black leotard striking a ballet pose. The confrontation dialogue plays and the level clears.</p>
      <p class="ts">Video check: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=blrfxQPl7Ss&t=62s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">1:02</a></p>
    </div>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
   
    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 30?</summary><p>Remove the ice block, golden mask, black eye mask and party hat, then tap through the skincare, ginseng and gold watch reactions, and finally open the pink curtain. The man behind it is the true face and ends the level.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does Sweetheart's face keep changing in Level 30?</summary><p>Each tap strips one more \"mask\" layer, and each gift answer replaces her face with a new exaggerated reaction. The level is a running gag about never seeing the real person until the curtain reveal.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is this Level 30 walkthrough exact?</summary><p>The removal order and the curtain reveal are confirmed against full-video frame-by-frame reads. A few of the gift-reaction steps are reconstructed from a single video source, so if one tap looks different on your screen, check the embedded video at that timestamp.</p></details>

